  "message": "Name the release after the paper: when-nominal-false-positive-rates-fail\n\nThe repository was named for the exploratory 3-D visualisation project it\nbegan as, which is no longer in it. It now carries the paper's title, the same\nname as the built PDF, and Section VIII cites the new URL.\n\nSection VIII cites the tag v1 rather than a commit hash: a commit cannot\ncontain its own hash, and the tag pins the exact tree the PDF was built from.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Uw7w5HRE6DUJ26KMCB4NkB",
